00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:59.875
We have our regular it's a regular meeting regular Board of Finance meeting. We have our agenda it's been published, hopefully all have it or been able to see it. We have a lot to cover in addition to just having a presentation of the.

00:03:00.195 --> 00:03:07.955
Andover elementary school school budget, which is kind of the highlight and and it's going to kick off this budget season for us on the board of finance.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:15.400
