00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:38.975
years past. Andover is one of the highest performing schools in the state.

00:09:39.455 --> 00:09:43.055
Now we are in our second year of a pandemic.

00:09:43.455 --> 00:09:45.215
Last year our children's school

00:09:45.535 --> 00:09:47.455
was cut short by almost

00:09:48.415 --> 00:09:56.510
half a year. The administration at that time scrambled like other school districts to come up with distance learning. They did their best

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:58.430
they could with

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.270
what they had during an unprecedented

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:02.510
time.

00:10:03.295 --> 00:10:07.535
It was a struggle for all from the administration

00:10:07.535 --> 00:10:09.295
to our teachers, parents

00:10:09.615 --> 00:10:12.255
and our status of all our children.

00:10:13.055 --> 00:10:13.775
Children

00:10:14.175 --> 00:10:16.175
continue to struggle academically

00:10:16.175 --> 00:10:17.615
