00:10:41.545 --> 00:10:46.505
This brings me to one of the controversial issues which in my opinion should be

00:10:47.065 --> 00:10:48.105
controversial

00:10:48.105 --> 00:10:51.950
in kindergarten class size. Kindergarten and third grade are very

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:54.990
important years in

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.790
early childhood education.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:03.230
There's a very high possibility that some of these children coming into kindergarten

00:11:03.425 --> 00:11:05.745
are behind and or have not had

00:11:06.705 --> 00:11:08.625
any pre kindergarten education.

00:11:09.905 --> 00:11:10.465
The

00:11:10.865 --> 00:11:17.905
pandemic has set children back socially and academically. It's important to get these children caught up and recognized

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:20.910
any learning disabilities.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.870
It is important to recognize

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.430
these needs early

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:29.470
so that it does not cost us more in the future.

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.350
This brings me to another

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.305
point of investment.

00:11:34.625 --> 00:11:39.745
I know there's a concern in town about the failure to invest in infrastructure

00:11:39.905 --> 00:11:41.185
from years past.

00:11:42.305 --> 00:11:46.945
Now that has caught up with us. We have a lot crumbling on bridges, roads and other infrastructure.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.730
Though it is more costly now

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:56.050
to play catch up at least we have the ability to repair these things like infrastructure

00:11:56.130 --> 00:12:00.530
when it comes to education a failure to invest early

00:12:01.205 --> 00:12:03.925
on results in a failure later.

00:12:04.245 --> 00:12:09.765
However, unlike infrastructure education cannot be replaced down the road when it fails.

00:12:10.325 --> 00:12:17.420
These early years are our building blocks to our children's future and the future of our town our country and

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:18.620
our world.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.420
As a taxpayer and a father of four,

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.220
hope the Board of Finance

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.500
supports

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.540
the Board of Education's budget. Thank you for your time.

