I would like to call it an opportunity.

00:16:43.185 --> 00:16:46.945
Our town has needs that must be funded in order to operate and function

00:16:47.185 --> 00:16:48.065
roads,

00:16:48.065 --> 00:16:50.625
bridges, fire equipment, public works vehicles,

00:16:50.785 --> 00:16:55.930
residents, state trooper, all employees who work for the town and the list goes on. We

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:05.050
also have an exceptional and top performing elementary school that must be funded as well if we are to educate the youngest of our residents

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.290
and prepare them for our future. Trooper,

00:17:08.175 --> 00:17:11.375
As citizens of Andover we have a responsibility

00:17:11.695 --> 00:17:16.975
as well as an obligation to fund the needs not the wants but the needs of the sound.

00:17:17.695 --> 00:17:23.070
We cannot continue to the can down the street and not fund the things that need to be funded.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.750
I've lived in Wethersfield, Newington and West Hartford.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:32.750
I owned a business in West Hartford for eighteen years and worked as a teacher in South Windsor for seventeen years.

00:17:33.395 --> 00:17:38.675
I've never experienced the arguments and disagreements over budget that I've seen in Andover

00:17:38.755 --> 00:17:39.955
year after year.

00:17:41.315 --> 00:17:43.715
No one anywhere wants to pay higher taxes.

00:17:44.115 --> 00:17:48.800
As a senior citizen on a fixed income, paying more becomes more difficult for us.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:52.240
But as a resident, I know that I have a responsibility

00:17:52.320 --> 00:17:54.320
to my town and its residents.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:58.480
My daughter went through the West Hartford public school system k to 12.

00:17:59.115 --> 00:18:02.555
We moved to West Hartford because it had an outstanding school district.

00:18:02.875 --> 00:18:05.595
It had all the services and amenities as well.

00:18:06.155 --> 00:18:10.155
Katherine received the top rated education that has served her well as an adult.

00:18:10.555 --> 00:18:12.715
I'm thankful to the residents of West Hartford

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.160
who paid taxes to support our education

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.760
and all the amenities

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.680
that the town had to offer.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:22.880
Whenever there was a school budget referendum,

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:26.720
residents including my family always voted yes to support the school district.

00:18:27.725 --> 00:18:30.285
I taught in South Windsor for seventeen years.

00:18:30.845 --> 00:18:33.965
We had an awesome school district that was always at the forefront

00:18:33.965 --> 00:18:36.445
in terms of curriculum teaching and learning.

00:18:36.925 --> 00:18:38.765
As a teacher in South Windsor,

00:18:39.085 --> 00:18:42.605
we were given all that we needed to provide the best possible education

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.260
for our students.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:49.940
The residents of South Windsor voted in favor of a remodeled high school and middle school.

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:53.460
They are finishing up the building of four new elementary schools.

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:56.820
People in South Windsor placed a premium value on education.

00:18:58.405 --> 00:18:59.605
In Andover,

00:19:00.005 --> 00:19:01.605
we do not have tennis courts,

00:19:02.005 --> 00:19:03.125
golf courses,

00:19:03.365 --> 00:19:04.485
swimming pools,

00:19:04.565 --> 00:19:05.925
ice skating rinks,

00:19:06.165 --> 00:19:07.285
crash collection,

00:19:07.685 --> 00:19:09.125
parks, the list goes on.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.080
One of the greatest value that we do have in Andover is our school,

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.080
Andover Elementary School.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.840
When one teacher from South Windsor heard that we were moving to Andover,

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:22.720
our first words were Andover has a school to die for.

00:19:23.305 --> 00:19:25.625
It is the crown jewel of our rural town.

00:19:27.065 --> 00:19:31.705
How do all of these other towns do all of this and keep their taxes reasonable?

00:19:32.105 --> 00:19:35.865
In order to have enough revenue, you have to be able to pay for education

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.950
and all the other needs of the town.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.950
You really have only two choices.

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:42.830
One, raise taxes on the residents.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:47.230
Two, encourage commercial development and growth the business and industry.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.910
West Hartford and South Windsor have made an art form of commercial development.

00:19:51.645 --> 00:19:53.245
Why can't Andover

00:19:53.405 --> 00:19:54.925
at least try to compete?

00:19:55.485 --> 00:19:57.165
We have all of Route 6,

00:19:57.485 --> 00:20:00.845
but all the commercial development is down on Route 44 bypasses

00:20:00.845 --> 00:20:01.405
us.

00:20:02.125 --> 00:20:03.645
It is obvious but not easy.

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:07.920
We're going to have to actively pursue commercial development in Andover.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:13.1000
We can't keep with our keep up with our town needs and our Andover elementary school needs

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.760
by just raising mill rates.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:22.295
We can't keep putting off that which needs to be done. We have to support our town and our school.

00:20:22.855 --> 00:20:24.615
Costs will continue to rise.

00:20:25.015 --> 00:20:30.135
As taxpayers, we have to take care of our small town and our Andover elementary school.

00:20:30.535 --> 00:20:33.280
How are we going to continue fund our future needs?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.600
It's my hope that commercial development

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:38.160
is at the top of our list to increase revenue.

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:42.720
We can't keep putting all of the responsibility on the residents and taxpayers

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.840
of Andover.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.880
Until we bring business and industry to Andover,

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:49.265
our residents will have to sole responsibility

00:20:49.265 --> 00:20:52.225
of funding our town and school budgets.

00:20:52.705 --> 00:20:55.425
My sincere thank you to the Board of Finance,

00:20:55.585 --> 00:20:57.825
Board of Selectmen and Board of Education

00:20:57.985 --> 00:20:59.985
