We're all very happy to have somebody on board. This is going to be a

00:52:07.360 --> 00:52:10.320
big move forward for us, I think in a lot different ways.

00:52:11.695 --> 00:52:18.175
>> I'm looking forward to sloughing off some of the things I've had to do for the last three or four months

00:52:18.335 --> 00:52:20.975
to somebody that's actually qualified to do that.

