There probably will be some things the finance director

00:54:43.075 --> 00:54:43.875
will

00:54:43.875 --> 00:54:45.875
need to prepare for that.

00:54:46.360 --> 00:54:57.640
But right now we're trying to cover as much of that as possible by the auditors kind of stepped up and been willing to work on some of the financial statements that normally we do in house.

00:54:58.040 --> 00:55:00.465
So with a little luck in the next

00:55:00.785 --> 00:55:01.665
six

00:55:01.665 --> 00:55:04.385
weeks or so, we'll have a completed audit.

00:55:05.345 --> 00:55:06.945
Not ideal, but

00:55:07.265 --> 00:55:08.465
better than the alternative.

00:55:13.630 --> 00:55:14.590
>> Okay,

00:55:14.830 --> 00:55:15.710
very good.

