03:33:31.140 --> 03:33:33.380
those in favor say aye.

03:33:34.580 --> 03:33:36.100
Opposed or abstain?

03:33:37.085 --> 03:33:43.245
Hearing none, let us surprise. The motion passes seven to nothing. Thank you everybody for your assistance and help.

03:33:43.725 --> 03:33:54.095
It is going to be a long season and thanks for staying with us. Lots of work to be done. Lots of work already been done. Appreciate it. Take care everybody. Thanks Mark as usual.
